          "summary": "## **Quarterly Statement**\n\n## **Q1 2026**\n\n## [Reporting][1]\n\n## **We create change**\n\nAt BASF, we don’t wait for change, it’s something we create. Whether through breakthrough\ntechnologies or bold ideas, we are enabling change that matters – for the climate, for our partners,\nand for future generations.\n\n### [Learn more][2]\n\n## **Our “Winning Ways” strategy**\n\n[Read more][3]\n\n## **Smart Scientists**\n\nTake a look behind the scenes of the laboratory and get to know our researchers.\n\n[Read more][4]\n\n# Welcome to BASF in India\n\nApril 30, 2026\nEvents\n1. [Annual Shareholders’ Meeting 2026][5]\n2. [BASF Report 2025][6]\n3. [Conference Call Quarterly Statement Q1 2026][7]\n4. [Quarterly Statement Q1 2026][8]\nChemistry is our Passion\nOur “Winning Ways” Strategy\nOur ambition is to be the preferred chemical company to enable our customers’ green transformation.\n1. [Discover more][9]\nMagazine\nCreating Chemistry Magazine\nInsights into global challenges that move our world today and in the future.\n1. [Discover stories][10]\nAnnual Report\nBASF India Limited\nAnnual Report 2023-2024\n1. [Read more][11]\nNews\nMedia \nLatest news releases \n1. [View all news][12]\nSites and Contact\nMain Office\nUnit No.10A,10B & 10C (part),\n10^{th} Floor, Godrej One,\nPirojsha Nagar, Eastern Express Highway,\nVikhroli (East),\nMumbai - 400 079\nPhone: +91 22 6834 7000\n1. [Contact Us ][13]\n\n# Solutions for your industry\n1. [View all industries][14]\n2. [Product search][15]\n\nAgriculture\n\n1. [Discover more][16]\nAutomotive & Transportation\n1. [Discover more][17]\nChemicals\n \n1. [Discover more][18]\nConstruction\n \n1. [Discover more][19]\nDispersions & Resins\n \n1. [Discover more][20]\nElectronics & Electric\n \n1. [Discover more][21]\nEnergy & Resources\n \n1. [Discover more][22]\nFurniture & Wood\n \n1. [Discover more][23]\nHome Care, Industrial & Institutional Cleaning\n1. [Discover more][24]\nNutrition\n \n1. [Discover more][25]\nPackaging & Print\n \n1. [Discover more][26]\nPaints & Coatings\n \n1. [Discover more][27]\nPersonal Care & Hygiene\n \n1. [Discover more][28]\nPharmaceuticals\n \n1. [Discover more][29]\nPlastics & Rubber\n \n1. [Discover more][30]\nTextile, Leather & Footwear\n1. [Discover more][31]\nFind your product\n\n1. [Product search][32]\n\n# We empower businesses to become more sustainable\n\nClimate resilient agriculture \nWhy healthy soils are good for our food and the planet\nSoil degradation is one major challenge for farmers and is expected to increase in importance over\nthe next decades. Sustainable farming methods and collaboration can help making agriculture more\nresilient to climate change.\n1. [Discover the inspiring story][33]\nThe recycling of plastics\nWe are closing the loop from plastic waste to virgin-grade products.\n1. [More about our ChemCycling™ project][34]\nRenewable Energy for BASF \n\nAcquisition, Trade and Expertise – the energy concept of BASF.\n1. [Discover BASF Renewable Energy GmbH][35]\n\nBASF Venture Capital\nWe invest in young, fast-growing companies worldwide.\n1. [BASF Group’s corporate venture capital company][36]\n\n# People at BASF\n\nDiscover BASF as employer\nShape your future with us. We support you in growing beyond yourself.\n1. [Career at BASF][37]\n2. [Apply now][38]\nWe build on a culture of belonging\nOur differences make us successful.\n1. [Our diversity and inclusion programs][39]\nFair gender balance @BASF\nBy 2030, BASF aims to increase the proportion of female managers worldwide to 30 percent.\n1. [Promoting women in leadership][40]\nCode of Conduct\nPolicy For Prevention Of Sexual Haressment\nBASF India Limited (Company) believes that all its employees have the right to be treated with\ndignity and respect. The Company, in its Code of Conduct, strictly prohibits sexual harassment and\nother workplace harassment. Protection against sexual harassment and right to work with dignity are\nuniversally recognized human rights by international conventions and instruments.\n1. [Policy on POSH: BIL][41]\n2. [Composition of POSH Internal Committee][42]\n\n## Follow us\n\nCompany\n1. [Career][43]\n2. [Media][44]\n3. [Sustainability][45]\n4. [Innovation][46]\n\nProducts\n1. [Product Finder][47]\n2. [Industries][48]\n\nInformation\n1. [Latest News][49]\n2. [Multimedia][50]\n3. [Publications][51]\n4. [Locations][52]\n\nService\n1. [Compliance Hotline][53]\n2. [Data protection @BASF][54]\n\nCopyright © BASF 2026\n* [Disclaimer][55]\n* [Cookie Preference Center][56]\n* [Credits][57]\n* [Privacy Policy][58]\n* [Data protection @BASF][59]\n* [Contact][60]\nTOP\n\n[1]: https://www.basf.com/global/en/investors/calendar-and-publications/reporting\n[2]: /in/en/who-we-are/we-create-change\n[3]: /global/en/who-we-are/strategy\n[4]: https://www.basf.com/global/en/who-we-are/innovation\n[5]: https://www.basf.com/global/en/investors/calendar-and-publications/annual-shareholders-meeting/\nannual-shareholders-meeting-2026\n[6]: https://report.basf.com/2025/en/\n[7]: https://www.basf.com/global/en/investors/calendar-and-publications/calendar/2026/first-quarter-\nresults\n[8]: https://www.basf.com/dam/jcr:95fecc42-eb7a-4281-838b-b0b5b1"
