ts by international conventions and instruments.\n1. [Policy on POSH: BIL][41]\n2. [Composition of POSH Internal Committee][42]\n\n## Follow us\n\nCompany\n1. [Career][43]\n2. [Media][44]\n3. [Sustainability][45]\n4. [Innovation][46]\n\nProducts\n1. [Product Finder][47]\n2. [Industries][48]\n\nInformation\n1. [Latest News][49]\n2. [Multimedia][50]\n3. [Publications][51]\n4. [Locations][52]\n\nService\n1. [Compliance Hotline][53]\n2. [Data protection @BASF][54]\n\nCopyright © BASF 2026\n* [Disclaimer][55]\n* [Cookie Preference Center][56]\n* [Credits][57]\n* [Privacy Policy][58]\n* [Data protection @BASF][59]\n* [Contact][60]\nTOP\n\n[1]: https://www.basf.com/global/en/investors/calendar-and-publications/reporting\n[2]: /in/en/who-we-are/we-create-change\n[3]: /global/en/who-we-are/strategy\n[4]: https://www.basf.com/global/en/who-we-are/innovation\n[5]: https://www.basf.com/global/en/investors/calendar-and-publications/annual-shareholders-meeting/\nannual-shareholders-meeting-2026\n[6]: https://report.basf.com/2025/en/\n[7]: https://www.basf.com/global/en/investors/calendar-and-publications/calendar/2026/first-quarter-\nresults\n[8]: https://www.basf.com/dam/jcr:95fecc42-eb7a-4281-838b-b0b5b1951110/basf/www/global/documents/en/\ninvestor-relations/calendar-and-publications/reports/2026/BASF_Quarterly-Statement_01_2026.pdf?vid=y\nbnMGSLfrFL1UsFIXMroxbPQJDX9H33v\n[9]: /global/en/who-we-are/strategy\n[10]: /global/en/media/magazine\n[11]: \n[12]: /in/en/media/news-releases\n[13]: https://www.basf.com/in/en/who-we-are/sites-and-contacts.html\n[14]: https://www.basf.com/in/en/products.html\n[15]: https://products.basf.com/global/en\n[16]: /in/en/products/agriculture\n[17]: /in/en/products/automotive-and-transportation\n[18]: /in/en/products/chemicals\n[19]: /in/en\n[20]: /in/en/products/dispersion-resin\n[21]: /in/en/products/electronics-and-electric\n[22]: /in/en/products/energy-resources\n[23]: /in/en/products/furniture-and-wood\n[24]: /in/en/products/home-care-and-cle