][ Freudenberg Chemical\n    Specialities ][57][ Freudenberg Medical ][58]\n  * [ Innovation Insights ][59]\n  * [ Global Expertise ][60]\n  * [ Pioneering Portfolio ][61]\n    [ Freudenberg Sealing Technologies ][62][ Freudenberg Flow Technologies ][63][ Vibracoustic\n    ][64][ Freudenberg Performance Materials ][65][ Freudenberg Filtration Technologies ][66][ Japan\n    Vilene Company ][67][ Freudenberg Home and Cleaning Solutions ][68][ Freudenberg Chemical\n    Specialities ][69][ Freudenberg Medical ][70]\n  Your life is filled with Freudenberg\n  Discover the many Freudenberg products hidden in plain sight – woven into the devices, vehicles,\n  and environments we all encounter every day – often invisible, always vital.[Your life is filled\n  with Freudenberg][ Watch the video ][71]\n* Careers\n  Careers\n  * [ Why Freudenberg ][72]\n  * [ Job Worlds ][73]\n  * [ Your way to us ][74]\n    [ Career Events ][75]\n  * [ Why Freudenberg ][76]\n  * [ Job Worlds ][77]\n  * [ Your way to us ][78]\n    [ Career Events ][79]\n  We will WOW your world\n  [Illustrated graphics of several electronic devices against a blue Background][ Open Jobs ][80]\n* [Search]\n  [Search Icon]\n* Change languageen\n  * [en][81]\n  * [de][82]\n  * [CN][83]\n\n# Innovating Together\n\n**We provide creative technical solutions**\nfor demanding applications\n\n[More Info on AI-enhanced illustrations/animations Freudenberg]\n\nFreudenberg Material EXpertise\n\nOne of Freudenberg's unique core elements is our material expertise.\n\nOver the years, we have developed numerous high-performing and technically demanding materials to\nmeet customer requirements. These outstanding materials are the basis of our technologies and\nproducts across all business groups. The pictures and animations shown are AI-enhanced illustrations\nof microscopic images of materials developed by Freudenberg.\n\n[Enhanced illustration based on a microscopic image of a material created by Freudenberg]\n\nAI-enhanced illustrations/animations based on microscopic images of materials created by\nFreudenberg.\n\nYes No Ja Nej\n[Icon Freudenberg Market Segments]\n40\nmarket segments\n[Icon Freudenberg Employees]\n51,000\nemployees\n[Icon Freudenberg Countries]\n60\nCountries\n[Icon of stacked coins]\n11.7\nbillion (€) Sales\n* [\n  [a worker in blue clothes working on a machine, another man in the background is also working on\n  another machine]\n  COMPANY\n  What makes us\n  ][84]\n* [\n  [a big machine in a technology laboratory]\n  INNOVATIONS\n  Technical Solutions\n  ][85]\n* [\n  [a smiling woman with curly brown hair in front of a light blue background with various scribbled\n  items]\n  CAREERS\n  Why Freudenberg\n  ][86]\n\n## Freudenberg Business Groups\n\n### **Expertise across industries**\n\nIn the world of technology, Freudenberg is everywhere. Our innumerable seals, vibration control\ncomponents, technical textiles, filters, cleaning solutions, specialty chemicals, medical technology\nproducts and e-mobility solutions are just some of the innovations from our Business Groups driving\nour customers’ success. The high level of performance from our products is a result of our close\ncollaboration between our customers and partners. \n* [Seals and Vibration Control Technology]\n  Seals and Vibration Control Technology\n* [Technical Textiles and Filtration]\n  Technical Textiles and Filtration\n* [Cleaning Technologies and Products]\n  Cleaning Technologies and Products\n* [Specialties]\n  Specialties\n\n[Seals and Vibration Control Technology]Seals and Vibration Control Technology\n\n### Seals and Vibration Control Technology\n\n### Freudenberg Sealing Technologies\n\nFreudenberg Sealing Technologies is a global leader in advanced and innovative sealing solutions.\n\nIts products are used across numerous industries, including electric mobility and renewable energy.\n\n \n\n[ Portfolio ][87]\n[hydrogen tank with the Freudenberg logo]\n[ Portfolio ][88]\n\n### Freudenberg Flow Technologies\n\nFreudenberg Flow Technologies with the EagleBurgmann brand is one of the world’s leading\nmanufacturers of industrial sealing technology. Their products ensure a reliable operation of pumps,\ncompressors, stirring machines, and special equipment.\n\n[ Portfolio ][89]\n[a production site with two large steel pipes in the front]\n[ Portfolio ][90]\n\n### Vibracoustic\n\nVibracoustic is a global leader in NVH (noise, vibration, harshness) solutions for the automotive\nindustry. It provides customized solutions that enhances comfort, while improving efficiency, safety\nand vehicle longevity.\n\n \n\n[ Portfolio ][91]\n[3D mock-up of a car, highlighting specific parts of the engine]\n[ Portfolio ][92]\n[Technical Textiles and Filtration]Technical Textiles and Filtration\n\n### Technical Textiles and Filtration\n\n### Freudenberg Performance Materials\n\nFreudenberg Performance Materials is a leading global supplier of innovative technical textiles for\ndiverse markets and applications, including mobility and transport, construction, healthcare,\napparel, and footwear.\n\n \n\n \n\n[ Portfolio ][93]\n[a tall buidling with a green facade full of plants]\n[ Portfolio ][94]\n\n### Freudenberg Filtration Technologies\n\nFreudenberg Filtration Technologies specializes in air and liquid filtration solutions. Through its\nproducts, the company helps make industrial processes more efficient, conserve resources, and\nprotect people and the environment.\n\n \n\n[ Portfolio ][95]\n[a white air filter in a room next to a plant filtering blue particles from the air]\n[ Portfolio ][96]\n\n### Japan Vilene Company\n\nJapan Vilene Company has been one of the leading nonwoven manufacturers on the Japanese market since\nits establishment in 1960. The company offers a broad product portfolio for various applications in\nthe automotive, medical, electrical and industrial segments.\n\n[ Portfolio ][97]\n[a woman from behind driving a car]\n[ Portfolio ][98]\n[Cleaning Technologies and Products]Cleaning Technologies and Products\n\n### Cleaning Technologies and Products\n\n### Freudenberg Home and Cleaning Solutions\n\nFreudenberg Home and Cleaning Solutions is a global leader in household products and cleaning items.\nWith well-known brands such as Vileda® and O-Cedar® in their portfolio, they offer innovative\nsolutions that make everyday life easier for their customers.\n\n[ Portfolio ][99]\n[a vileda mop and a gray vileda bucket in front of a sofa]\n[ Portfolio ][100]\n[ Vileda® [Extern url]][101]\n[ Vileda Professional® [Extern url]][102]\n[ O-Cedar® [Extern url]][103]\n[ Gimi [Extern url]][104]\n[ Oates [Extern url]][105]\n[ Gala® [Extern url]][106]\n[ Wettex [Extern url]][107]\n[ Marigold® [Extern url]][108]\n[ Vermop® [Extern url]][109]\n[Specialties]Specialties\n\n### Specialties\n\n### Freudenberg Chemical Specialities\n\nFreudenberg Chemical Specialities is specialized in chemical products like surface treatment,\nlubricants, and release agents. With brands like Klüber Lubrication, Chem-Trend, SurTec, and CAPOL,\nthey ensure maximum efficiency and quality.\n\n \n\n \n\n[ Portfolio ][110]\n[gloved hands hold a measuring device in a round steel container with green beads]\n[ Portfolio ][111]\n\n### Freudenberg Medical\n\nFreudenberg Medical is a global partner to medical device and pharmaceutical companies, committed to\ndelivering precision components, special needles, and catheter solutions for minimally invasive\nproduct solutions, among other products.\n\n \n\n \n\n[ Portfolio ][112]\n[Two hands wearing blue medical gloves working on a catheter]\n[ Portfolio ][113]\n\n### Financials for 2025\n\n\nFreudenberg holds its ground in a challenging environment – strong key financial figures in 2025\nunderscore stability and future viability of the Group.\n\n[ Read Press release and Download Annual Report 2025 [download]][114]\n\n**Offer Site for Shareholders in Nilfisk Holding A/S / **\n\n**Tilbudssite til aktionærer i Nilfisk Holding A/S**\n\n[ Learn more ][115]\n[Illustration of a blue paper and a pen]\n[two young women and a young man in business casual clothes walking next to each other smiling]\n\n**Career**\n\n## OPPORTUNITIES AWAIT YOU AT FREUDENBERG\n\nThat's our promise which is evident through our international  collaboration, ambitious and\nsustainable innovations, and continued  focus on the future. As a global technology group, we not\nonly make the world cleaner, healthier and more comfortable, but also offer our more  than 52,000\nemployees a globally connected and inclusive environment  where everyone can develop individually.\n\nWe are proud of our work. We develop products you often don’t see, but those products are making the\nworld better.\n\n[ Discover more ][116]\n\n## MATERIALS: THE CORE OF OUR EXPERTISE\n\n \n\nThere is a common denominator all Freudenberg products share: materials excellence. We provide\nmaterials for high-quality, long-lasting solutions for thousands of demanding applications, often\ndeveloping them to meet a specific customer need.\n\n\nThis takes a deep understanding of materials science. Freudenberg offers an extensive array of\nelastomers, thermoplastics, lubricants and other materials in its portfolios. And with our expertise\nand state-of-the-art testing facilities we can quickly identify specific formulations based on our\ncustomer’s needs.  \n\n[ Discover more ][117]\n\nPress & Media\n\n## Our latest press releases\n\n[ More press releases ][118]\n[ Read more ][119]\n20.05.2026\n\n### Freudenberg Flow Technologies acquires Balmoral Comtec\n\nFreudenberg strengthens business in energy sector\n\n[ Read more ][120]\n15.04.2026\n\n### Freudenberg Home and Cleaning Solutions completes takeover offer of Nilfisk\n\nFreudenberg Home and Cleaning Solutions (FHCS) announces the successful completion of its voluntary…\n\n[ Read more ][121]\n30.03.2026\n\n### Freudenberg presents financials for 2025\n\nFreudenberg holds its ground in a challenging environment – strong key financial figures underscore…\n\nCompany\n\n## SOCIAL WALL\n\n## Freudenberg FAQ\n\nWhat is the Freudenberg Group?\n\nThe Freudenberg Group is a global, family-owned technology and materials company headquartered in\nWeinheim, Germany. Founded in 1849, Freudenberg develops advanced materials and components for\nindustrial and consumer markets worldwide. "
