, and across these markets.\n\n[\nChemicals & Intermediates\n][47]\n[\nConsumer Goods & Appliances\n][48]\n[\nCORDURA® *Advanced Fabrics*\n][49]\n[\nElectrical & Electronics\n][50]\n[\nFiber & Textiles\n][51]\n[\nFood & Beverage\n][52]\n[\nHealthcare & Medical\n][53]\n[\nIndustrial\n][54]\n[\nPackaging\n][55]\n[\nTransportation & Mobility\n][56]\n[A close-up image of a hand holding transparent plastic resin pellets. The setting highlights the\ntexture and clarity of the pellets, which are scattered across a surface. The image emphasizes\nindustrial material used in manufacturing processes.]\n\n## Products made possible\n\nOur materials enable strong, dependable and durable products — from automotive components to medical\nequipment, apparel to food packaging, and far beyond. Discover how our innovative solutions support\ncustomer needs by creating high-quality products.\n\n[ See our products ][57]\n[A worker wearing a hard hat and safety gear stands confidently in an industrial plant setting. The\nbackground features metal structures, pipes, and equipment, indicating a manufacturing or processing\nfacility. The worker's uniform includes visible tools and a communication device, emphasizing a\nprofessional and safety-conscious environment.]\n\n## Creating value responsibly\n\nAcross our business, we work to minimize our environmental impact while maximizing long-term\nbenefits for our customers, our communities and society. The goal: doing more using less while\ncreating lasting results.\n\n[ Our commitment ][58]\n\n## Ready to explore solutions?\n\nWhether you’re exploring our products, seeking technical support or are simply interested in\ncollaboration opportunities, we’re here to help. Share your details, and let’s connect.\n\n[ Explore our products ][59] [ Contact us ][60]\n\n[ About ][61]\n\n[ Stewardship ][62]\n\n[ Markets ][63]\n\n[ Products ][64]\n\n[ Careers ][65]\n\n[ News ][66]\n\n[ Contact ][67]\n\n[\nFacebook ][68]\n\n[\nLinkedIn ][69]\n\n[ INVISTA Prod