          "summary": "[Skip to main content][1]\nEnglish\n\n[ English ][2]\n\n[ 中文 ][3]\n\n[ About ][4]\n\n[ Stewardship ][5]\n\n[ Environmental ][6]\n\n[ Social ][7]\n\n[ Governance ][8]\n\n[ Markets ][9]\n\n[ Chemicals & Intermediates ][10]\n\n[ Consumer Goods & Appliances ][11]\n\n[ CORDURA® *Advanced Fabrics* ][12]\n\n[ Electrical & Electronics ][13]\n\n[ Fiber & Textiles ][14]\n\n[ Food & Beverage ][15]\n\n[ Healthcare & Medical ][16]\n\n[ Industrial ][17]\n\n[ Packaging ][18]\n\n[ Transportation & Mobility ][19]\n\n[ Careers ][20]\n\n[ News ][21]\n\n[ Contact ][22]\n\n[ See our products ][23]\n\n[ About ][24]\n\nStewardship\n\n[ Overview ][25]\n\n[ Environmental ][26]\n\n[ Social ][27]\n\n[ Governance ][28]\n\nMarkets\n\n[ Overview ][29]\n\n[ Chemicals & Intermediates ][30]\n\n[ Consumer Goods & Appliances ][31]\n\n[ CORDURA® *Advanced Fabrics* ][32]\n\n[ Electrical & Electronics ][33]\n\n[ Fiber & Textiles ][34]\n\n[ Food & Beverage ][35]\n\n[ Healthcare & Medical ][36]\n\n[ Industrial ][37]\n\n[ Packaging ][38]\n\n[ Transportation & Mobility ][39]\n\nCareers\n\n[ News ][40]\n\n[ Contact ][41]\n\n[ See our products ][42]\n\nEnglish\n\n[ English ][43]\n\n[ 中文 ][44]\n\n[A stylish man in casual attire walks confidently past a sleek, glass-fronted building. The image\ntransitions to a dynamic view of a luxury car speeding on a sunny road. The visuals emphasize urban\nsophistication and modern mobility.]\n\n# Materials that move the world\n\nINVISTA creates the chemicals, polymers and fibers essential to countless products that people\ndepend on to live, work and move the world forward.\n\n[ Explore our products ][45] [ Learn more about INVISTA ][46]\n\n## Customer-focused solutions across industries\n\nCustomers count on INVISTA for advantaged technology, world-class materials, high-quality value and\nthe integrity to deliver on our promises. These factors and a focus on building long-term\nrelationships are what make INVISTA a preferred partner across continents, and across these markets.\n\n[\nChemicals & Intermediates\n][47]\n[\nConsumer Goods & Appliances\n][48]\n[\nCORDURA® *Advanced Fabrics*\n][49]\n[\nElectrical & Electronics\n][50]\n[\nFiber & Textiles\n][51]\n[\nFood & Beverage\n][52]\n[\nHealthcare & Medical\n][53]\n[\nIndustrial\n][54]\n[\nPackaging\n][55]\n[\nTransportation & Mobility\n][56]\n[A close-up image of a hand holding transparent plastic resin pellets. The setting highlights the\ntexture and clarity of the pellets, which are scattered across a surface. The image emphasizes\nindustrial material used in manufacturing processes.]\n\n## Products made possible\n\nOur materials enable strong, dependable and durable products — from automotive components to medical\nequipment, apparel to food packaging, and far beyond. Discover how our innovative solutions support\ncustomer needs by creating high-quality products.\n\n[ See our products ][57]\n[A worker wearing a hard hat and safety gear stands confidently in an industrial plant setting. The\nbackground features metal structures, pipes, and equipment, indicating a manufacturing or processing\nfacility. The worker's uniform includes visible tools and a communication device, emphasizing a\nprofessional and safety-conscious environment.]\n\n## Creating value responsibly\n\nAcross our business, we work to minimize our environmental impact while maximizing long-term\nbenefits for our customers, our communities and society. The goal: doing more using less while\ncreating lasting results.\n\n[ Our commitment ][58]\n\n## Ready to explore solutions?\n\nWhether you’re exploring our products, seeking technical support or are simply interested in\ncollaboration opportunities, we’re here to help. Share your details, and let’s connect.\n\n[ Explore our products ][59] [ Contact us ][60]\n\n[ About ][61]\n\n[ Stewardship ][62]\n\n[ Markets ][63]\n\n[ Products ][64]\n\n[ Careers ][65]\n\n[ News ][66]\n\n[ Contact ][67]\n\n[\nFacebook ][68]\n\n[\nLinkedIn ][69]\n\n[ INVISTA Product SDS ][70]\n\n[ UK Modern Slavery Act ][71]\n\n[ Canada Forced and Child Labour Act ][72]\n\n[ Supply Chain Transparency ][73]\n\n[ Disclosures ][74]\n\n[ Code of Conduct ][75]\n\n[ Privacy Policy ][76]\n\n[ Terms of Use ][77]\n\n[ EU Whistleblower Policy ][78]\n\nCookies Settings\n\n©2026 INVISTA. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: /\n[3]: /cn/\n[4]: /about\n[5]: /stewardship\n[6]: /stewardship/environmental\n[7]: /stewardship/social\n[8]: /stewardship/governance\n[9]: /markets\n[10]: /markets/chemicals-intermediates\n[11]: /markets/consumer-goods-appliances\n[12]: /markets/cordura-advanced-fabrics\n[13]: /markets/electrical-electronics\n[14]: /markets/fiber-textiles\n[15]: /markets/food-beverage\n[16]: /markets/healthcare-medical\n[17]: /markets/industrial\n[18]: /markets/packaging\n[19]: /markets/transportation-mobility\n[20]: https://kochcareers.com/invista\n[21]: /news\n[22]: /contact\n[23]: /products\n[24]: /about\n[25]: /stewardship\n[26]: /stewardship/environmental\n[27]: /stewardship/social\n[28]: /stewardship/governance\n[29]: /markets\n[30]: /markets/chemicals-intermediates\n[31]: /markets/consumer-goods-appliances\n[32]: /markets/cordura-advanced-fabrics\n[33]: /markets/electrical-electronics\n[34]: /markets/fiber-textiles\n"
