History\n    \n    ][28]\n* #### Newsroom\n  * [\n    \n    #### News & events\n    \n    ][29]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Multimedia\n    \n    ][30]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Reporting\n    \n    ][31]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Disclosed inside information / Ad-hoc messages\n    \n    ][32]\n[Contact][33]\nen\n* [DE][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Applications][36]\n* [Technology & Production][37]\n* [People & Planet][38]\n* [Investors][39]\n* [About Us][40]\n* [Newsroom][41]\n[Contact][42]\nen\n\nFIBERS FOR LIFE\n\n# Lenzing – your partner for sustainable innovations and better fibers\n\n[get to know us][43]\n\nOver 1000 brands trust Lenzing\n* [naif logo]\n* [kudos logo]\n* [e-d-di logo]\n* [beststeller logo]\n* [calzedonia logo]\n* [carefree logo]\n* [guess logo]\n* [h&m logo]\n* [armedangles logo]\n* [naif logo]\n* [kudos logo]\n* [e-d-di logo]\n* [beststeller logo]\n* [calzedonia logo]\n* [carefree logo]\n* [guess logo]\n* [h&m logo]\n* [armedangles logo]\n\nABOUT US\n\nFor over 80 years, Lenzing has been producing better fibers − with cellulose as our renewable raw\nmaterial. Solutions from Lenzing are as inventive as they are effective when it comes to caring for\nour partners’ success, the needs of our planet, and the demands of everyday life. We’re glad you’re\nhere. Feel free to explore. And get in touch if you have any questions.\n\n[learn more][44]\n\nPRODUCT LINES\n\n## Our products are derived from cellulose – the better choice for today and tomorrow\n\n## Partnering for impact – Driving meaningful change in the textile and nonwoven industry through\n## strategic alliances\n\nLenzing drives transformation through strategic partnerships with global sustainability leaders.\nFrom serving on the boards of Textile Exchange and Cascale to co-founding the Renewable Carbon\nInitiative, we actively shape standards and practices across the fiber and textile industries.\n\n[get inspired][45]\nBRANDS\n\n## The brand world of the Lenzing Group\n\nStand out in the market with globally-recognized brands that your customers trust and value. Our\nTENCEL™, VEOCEL™, LENZING™ ECOVERO™ and LENZING™ brands signal high product quality and responsible\nmanufacturing practices.\n[][46][][47][][48][][49]\n[explore brands][50]\n\nCONTACT FORM\n\n## How can we best support you? Get in touch!\n\nName\nCompany\nCountry\nSelect country\nE-Mail-Address\nPhone\nYour Message\n\nYou can find the privacy notice of Lenzing AG [here][51]. \n\nLoading captcha...\nsend message\n[Woodyard]\n\n## Thank you very much for your request!\n\nWe´ll get in touch with you as soon as possible. Best regards, Your Lenzing Team\n\nback\n[[Lenzing Logo]][52]\n\nLenzing Aktiengesellschaft\n\nWerkstraße 2\n\n4860 Lenzing, Austria\n\n[+43 (0) 7672 701-0][53][[email protected]][54]\n\n## Lenzing\n* [Careers we're hiring][55]\n* [Investor relations ][56]\n* [Certificates & evaluations ][57]\n* [Contact ][58]\n* [Emergency information ][59]\n\n## B2B\n* [Products ][60]\n* [Global procurement ][61]\n* [Wood purchasing ][62]\n* [Branding service ][63]\n* [Download center ][64]\n\n## B2C\n* [TENCEL™ ][65]\n* [VEOCEL™ ][66]\n* [LENZING™ ECOVERO™ ][67]\n\n## News\n* [Annual & Sustainability Report ][68]\n* [Reporting ][69]\n* [Newsroom ][70]\n* [Carved in Blue ][71]\n\nLenzing AG Copyright 2026\n\n[facebook][72][linkedin][73]\n*"
