lly-recognized brands that your customers trust and value. Our\nTENCEL™, VEOCEL™, LENZING™ ECOVERO™ and LENZING™ brands signal high product quality and responsible\nmanufacturing practices.\n[][46][][47][][48][][49]\n[explore brands][50]\n\nCONTACT FORM\n\n## How can we best support you? Get in touch!\n\nName\nCompany\nCountry\nSelect country\nE-Mail-Address\nPhone\nYour Message\n\nYou can find the privacy notice of Lenzing AG [here][51]. \n\nLoading captcha...\nsend message\n[Woodyard]\n\n## Thank you very much for your request!\n\nWe´ll get in touch with you as soon as possible. Best regards, Your Lenzing Team\n\nback\n[[Lenzing Logo]][52]\n\nLenzing Aktiengesellschaft\n\nWerkstraße 2\n\n4860 Lenzing, Austria\n\n[+43 (0) 7672 701-0][53][[email protected]][54]\n\n## Lenzing\n* [Careers we're hiring][55]\n* [Investor relations ][56]\n* [Certificates & evaluations ][57]\n* [Contact ][58]\n* [Emergency information ][59]\n\n## B2B\n* [Products ][60]\n* [Global procurement ][61]\n* [Wood purchasing ][62]\n* [Branding service ][63]\n* [Download center ][64]\n\n## B2C\n* [TENCEL™ ][65]\n* [VEOCEL™ ][66]\n* [LENZING™ ECOVERO™ ][67]\n\n## News\n* [Annual & Sustainability Report ][68]\n* [Reporting ][69]\n* [Newsroom ][70]\n* [Carved in Blue ][71]\n\nLenzing AG Copyright 2026\n\n[facebook][72][linkedin][73]\n* [Confidential whistleblower system][74]\n* [Privacy notice][75]\n* [Terms of use][76]\n* [GTC][77]\n* [Legal notices][78]\n* Cookie Consent Management\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: /\n[3]: /products/dissolving-wood-pulp/\n[4]: /applications/home-textiles/\n[5]: /applications/protective-wear/\n[6]: /applications/packaging/\n[7]: /applications/automotive-interiors/\n[8]: /applications/surface-home-cleaning/\n[9]: /applications/engineered-products/\n[10]: /technology-production/technologies/\n[11]: /technology-production/biorefinery/\n[12]: /people-planet/targets-strategy/\n[13]: /people-planet/circular-economy/\n[14]: /people-planet/decarbonization/\n[15]: /people-planet/c