122]\n  * [Overview][123]\n  * [Performance and Financial Highlights][124]\n    * [Back][125]\n    * [Performance Financial Highlights][126]\n    * [Annual Reports][127]\n    * [Quarterly Financial Statements][128]\n    * [Earnings Release][129]\n    * [Earnings Call Presentation][130]\n  * [Dividends][131]\n  * [Debt, Bonds & Maturities][132]\n  * [Corporate Credit Ratings][133]\n  * [Corporate Governance][134]\n  * [FAQ and Contact][135]\n    * [Back][136]\n    * [Contact Details][137]\n    * [FAQs][138]\n* [News and Media][139]\n  * [Back][140]\n  * [SABIC News & Media][141]\n  * [Latest News][142]\n  * [Reports][143]\n  * [Stories][144]\n  * [Publications][145]\n  * [Photos][146]\n  * [SABIC Videos][147]\n  * [Logos][148]\n  * [Social Media][149]\n  * [Events][150]\n* [ [SABIC GLOBE] Search ][151] Type here to search <[SABIC GLOBE]Submit\n* [ [SABIC GLOBE] Contact Us ][152]\n  * [Back][153]\n  * [Contact Us][154]\n  * [Locations][155]\n* [ [SABIC GLOBE] Change Region ][156]\n  * [عربي][157]\n  * [中文][158]\n  * [English][159]\n* [ [SABIC GLOBE] E-Portals ][160]\n  * [Back][161]\n  * [E-BUSINESS PORTAL SABIC][162]\n  * [SUPPLIER PORTAL SABIC][163]\n* [[SABIC REGISTRATION]User][164]\n  * [Back][165]\n  * [Login][166]\n  * [Register][167]\n\n[50 Yrs Website Banner]\n[Overlay 50]\n[Anniversary]\n\n# ABOUT SABIC\n\nFrom making cars and planes more fuel-efficient, to helping conserve the world’s water supply and\nenabling colorful smartphone cases, we find solutions to the challenges of today to help our\ncustomers achieve their ambitions and build a better tomorrow.\n\n## Our Industries\n* [ [agriculture]Agriculture ][168]\n* [ [automotice]Automotive ][169]\n* [ [Building]Building & Construction ][170]\n* [ [Consumer]Consumer ][171]\n* [ [Electrical]Electrical & Electronics ][172]\n* [ [Healthcare]Hygiene & Healthcare ][173]\n* [ [Industrial]Industrial ][174]\n* [ [Mass]Mass Transportation ][175]\n* [ [Packaging]Packaging ][176]\n\n[OUR INDUSTRIES][177]\n\n[A man holding looking at a tablet screen with a chart]\n\n## Products\n\nWe gain insights by understanding our customers’ needs and use our technical expertise to tailor\nsolutions to help maximize their market advantage moving forward.\n\n[OUR PRODUCTS][178]\n\n## Sustainability\n\nSustainability is a vital part of our core business strategy. We're making sure we understand the\nmegatrends that will impact on our lives in the years to come.\n\n[LATEST SUSTAINABILITY REPORTING][179]\n[Two]\n\n## Investors\n\nWe’re committed to long-term investments and business partnerships, by harnessing innovation,\nlearning and operational excellence.\n\n[INVESTORS][180]\n\n## CAREERS\n\nPeople have helped us to develop, produce and market innovative solutions that make a difference\nboth to industry and to humanity. At SABIC we enable you to realize your ideas and make an impact.\n\n[VIEW JOB OPPORTUNITIES][181]\n[Three people looking at a whiteboard]\n[\n][182]\n\n## Our Brand\n\nWe believe the answer to some of the world's biggest challenges lies in the natural human instinct\nto collaborate. Together we're making Chemistry that Matters™.\n\n[Our Brand][183]\n\n## Our Stories\n\nFor over 45 years, our ambition to define the future of petrochemicals has yielded solutions for the\nchallenges of today and helped our customers achieve their ambitions for a better tomorrow. We are\nmaking a meaningful impact in the world and delivering Chemistry that Matters™.\n\n[Read our stories][184]\n\n## LATEST NEWS\n\n[\n[SABIC’S]\n][185]\n[\n\n### SABIC’S New LNP™ Thermocomp™ OFM Compounds Help Enable High-Voltage Power Modules\n\n][186]\n[\n[laptop]\n][187]\n[\n\n### SABIC LAUNCHES NOVEL PCR-BASED LNP™ ELCRIN™ COMPOUND WITH ENHANCED PERFORMANCE\n\n][188]\n[\n[Battery]\n][189]\n[\n\n### SABIC showcases at the battery show Europe its full EV battery material ecosystem for higher\n### performance from pack to power components\n\n][190]\n\n[LATEST NEWS][191]\n\nCompare up to 4 grades\n\nYou already have 