ishes ][144]\n  * Protective clothing\n    * [ Protective workwear ][145]\n    * [ Fire fighting clothing ][146]\n    * [ Maritime protective clothing ][147]\n    * [ Military and ballistic protection ][148]\n    * [ Forestry and arboriculture clothing ][149]\n    * [ Outdoor and lifestyle clothing ][150]\n* Markets\n  * [ Transportation & automotive ][151]\n  * [ Maritime & Fishing ][152]\n  * [ Industry & construction ][153]\n  * [ Public safety & Security ][154]\n  * [ Sports & Leisure ][155]\n  * [ Fire & Rescue ][156]\n  * [ Forestry & Agriculture ][157]\n  * [ Food & Storage ][158]\n  * [ Publicity & events ][159]\n  * [ Energy ][160]\n  * [ Landscape & Architecture ][161]\n* Group\n  * [ About ][162]\n  * Brands\n    * [ Technical Textiles ][163]\n    * [ Protective Clothing ][164]\n    * [ Colouring Solutions ][165]\n  * [ History ][166]\n  * [ Plants & locations ][167]\n  * [ Corporate governance ][168]\n* R&D\n  * [ Part of our DNA ][169]\n  * [ Our testing equipment ][170]\n* [ News & events ][171]\n* [ Jobs ][172]\n* [ Sustainability ][173]\n[ Contact ][174]\nEN\nEnglish\n* [ Deutsch ][175]\n* [ English ][176]\n* [ Français ][177]\n* [ Nederlands ][178]\n\n# Protecting people and their belongings\n\nShaping your future with technical textiles\n\n## Creating a safer world with Sioen\n\nWelcome to Sioen, where we do more than just make fabrics — we innovate safety. Leading the way in\ntechnical textiles, we design essential solutions for sectors including firefighting, construction,\nand maritime. From pioneering PVC-coated textiles to developing durable geotextiles, our creations\nensure quality and reliability.\n* Global reach\n  \n  Sioen's technical textiles and protective wear are trusted by professionals worldwide. Our\n  extensive network ensures that our innovative solutions are accessible in every corner of the\n  globe.\n* Quality Control\n  \n  Our rigorous testing processes and state-of-the-art facilities guarantee that every product not\n  only meets but exceeds global standards, ensuring reliability in every thread.\n* Research & Innovation\n  \n  Our dedicated teams dive deep into the science of textiles, pioneering new materials and\n  techniques that redefine industry standards and push the boundaries of what's possible.\n\nMission, Vision & Values\n\n## Protection through innovation\n\nSioen is the world market leader in technical textiles and technical apparel, protecting people and\ntheir belongings.\n\n[ Read our strategy ][179]\n\n## Our Solutions\n\nAt Sioen, we innovate across three core divisions: dive deeper and discover the breadth of Sioen’s\ntextile engineering excellence, subtly present in the fabric of everyday life.\n\n### Technical Textiles\n\nWe create technical textiles designed for specific tasks across various markets like transport,\nindustry & construction.\n\n[\n\nWoven fabrics\n\n][180] [\n\nNon-woven fabrics\n\n][181] [\n\nCoated textiles\n\n][182] [\n\nScrims\n\n][183] [\n\nFilms & sheets\n\n][184] [\n\nLaminates\n\n][185] [\n\nComposites\n\n][186] [\n\nServices & solutions\n\n][187]\nShow more\nShow less\n\n### Colouring Solutions\n\nWe specialise in creating custom and standard colouring solutions, including high-quality pigment\ndispersions, inks, and varnishes.\n\n[\n\nPigment dispersions\n\n][188] [\n\nDecorative inks\n\n][189] [\n\nVarnishes\n\n][190]\nShow more\nShow less\n\n### Protective Clothing\n\nWe offer unrivalled expertise in professional protective clothing, which can shield you from any\nrisk.\n\n[\n\nProtective workwear\n\n][191] [\n\nFire fighting clothing\n\n][192] [\n\nMaritime protective clothing\n\n][193] [\n\nMilitary and ballistic protection\n\n][194] [\n\nForestry and arboriculture clothing\n\n][195] [\n\nOutdoor and lifestyle clothing\n\n][196]\nShow more\nShow less\n\n## Markets in which we're active\n* Transportation & automotive\n  \n  [ Read more ][197]\n* Maritime & Fishing\n  \n  [ Read more ][198]\n* Industry & construction\n  \n  [ Read more ][199]\n* Public safety & Security\n  \n  [ Read more ][200]\n* Sports & Leisure\n  \n  [ Read more ][201]\n* Fire & Rescue\n  \n  [ Read more ][202]\n* Forestry & Agriculture\n  \n  [ Read more ][203]\n* Food & Storage\n  \n  [ Read more ][204]\n* Publicity & events\n  \n  [ Read more ][205]\n* Energy\n  \n  [ Read more ][206]\n* Landscape & Architecture\n  \n  [ Read more ][207]\n\nShow all\n\nTransportation & automotive\n\n[ Read more ][208]\n\nMaritime & Fishing\n\n[ Read more ][209]\n\nIndustry & construction\n\n[ Read more ][210]\n\nPublic safety & Security\n\n[ Read more ][211]\n\nSports & Leisure\n\n[ Read more ][212]\n\nFire & Rescue\n\n[ Read more ][213]\n\nForestry & Agriculture\n\n[ Read more ][214]\n\nFood & Storage\n\n[ Read more ][215]\n\nPublicity & events\n\n[ Read more ][216]\n\nEnergy\n\n[ Read more ][217]\n\nLandscape & Architecture\n\n[ Read more ][218]\n\n## Sioen's ESG commitment\n\nSioen embraces the triple bottom line: People, Planet, Profit. Our commitment to environmental care,\nsocial empowerment, and sustainable profit guides every innovation and decision. By integrating\nresponsible practices into our core, we aim to make a lasting impact on the world and lead by\nexample in our industry.\n\n[ Discover our ESG website ][219]\n\n## Innovation at our core\n\nAt Sioen, we rigorously test our products to ensure a satisfactory customer experience. Discover how\nour R&D department guarantees that all our textile products meet the highest standards of quality\nand performance through comprehensive testing.\n\n[ Experience our drive for innovation ][220]\nCareer & Culture\n\n## Become a part of our team\n\n\"Passioen\" is what drives us. Join us and contribute to a world where safety, sustainability, and\ninnovation merge. Our company culture celebrates creativity, teamwork, and the pursuit of\nexcellence. Discover your next opportunity with us.\n\n[ View career page ][221]\n\n## Stay updated\n\n[ View all ][222]\nNews\n\nSioen wins European 