lectronics and building materials where performance, compliance and reliability are\n        essential.\n        \n        [Explore industry-specific polymer solutions][26]\n    * * [Building & ConstructionMaterials that withstand weather, UV, and structural demands in\n        outdoor and load-bearing applications.][27]\n      * [TransportationEngineered compounds built for durability, compliance, and reliability across\n        vehicles, aircraft, ag, and power sports.][28]\n      * [FibersSoftness, strength, and stability for nonwovens, synthetic turf, hygiene products,\n        and performance textiles.][29]\n    * * [PackagingCustom masterbatches and additives for barrier performance, clarity, and\n        sustainable packaging formats.][30]\n      * [HealthcareMedical-grade materials engineered for biocompatibility, sterilization, and\n        global regulatory compliance.][31]\n      * [ElectronicsFlame-retardant, antistatic, and heat-resistant compounds for electronic\n        housings and sensitive components.][32]\n    * * [IndustrialHigh-strength, chemical-resistant materials designed for demanding environments\n        and engineered systems.][33]\n* [Services & Expertise][34]\n  * * * Services & Expertise\n        \n        Americhem isn’t just a compounder, we are a full-service extension of your engineering,\n        marketing, and product development teams.\n        \n        [Learn about our Services][35]\n    * * [Analytical TestingPrecision testing for performance, compliance, and quality\n        assurance.][36]\n      * [Product Design ServicesCollaborative design support for function, form, and\n        manufacturability.][37]\n      * [Custom ManufacturingFlexible, scalable production tailored to your exact formulation\n        needs.][38]\n    * * [Customer Process SimulationSimulate real-world processing to speed development and reduce\n        risk.][39]\n      * [Field ServicesOn-site technical support for trials, troubleshooting, and optimization.][40]\n    * * [CertificationsGlobal certifications that ensure material quality and compliance.][41]\n      * [SustainabilitySolutions that support your environmental and sustainability goals.][42]\n* [About][43]\n  * * * About Americhem\n        \n        For more than eight decades, Americham has been your trusted global partner in designing and\n        manufacturing polymer solutions.\n        \n        [Learn more about Americhem][44]\n    * * [LocationsGlobal reach with local expertise, explore Americhem’s worldwide footprint.][45]\n      * [LeadershipMeet the experts guiding Americhem’s vision, innovation, and global growth.][46]\n    * * [DEIWe foster a culture where diversity, equity, and inclusion drive stronger\n        solutions.][47]\n      * [RegulatoryCommitted to compliance, quality, and customer assurance at every stage.][48]\n    * * [[A group of people sit around tables in a conference room, listening to a speaker at a\n        podium; one woman gestures while speaking.][A group of people sit around tables in a\n        conference room, listening to a speaker at a podium; "
