          "text": "[Skip to Main Content][1]\n* [Careers][2]\n* [Sustainability][3]\n* [Technical Data Sheets][4]\n* [Resource Library][5]\n  * [Case Studies][6]\n  * [White Papers][7]\n  * [Webinars][8]\n  * [Videos][9]\n  * [Articles][10]\n  * [News][11]\n  * [Events][12]\n  * [Marketing Materials][13]\n  * [Quality Manual][14]\nSearch\n[Back to home[Americhem logo featuring a green circle with three horizontal gray lines, and the\nwords \"Americhem: Performance | Solutions | Trust\" in blue and green text.]][15]\nToggle Navigation\n* [Products & Materials][16]\n  * * * Product Families\n  * * * Products & Materials\n        \n        We collaborate closely with your team to deliver application-specific plastic compounds and\n        accelerate your time to market.\n        \n        [View all Products & Materials][17]\n        \n        [Explore our Custom Capabilities ][18]\n    * * [Masterbatch TechnologyCustom color masterbatches and additive masterbatches designed for\n        precision, consistency and appearance-critical parts.][19]\n      * [Functional TechnologyThermoplastic additive technologies including softening agents, flame\n        retardants, UV stabilizers, antimicrobials and more.][20]\n    * * [Performance CompoundsEngineered compounds for strength, impact resistance, heat deflection\n        and chemical compatibility.][21]\n      * [Engineered CompoundsCustom formulations developed to meet unique end-use, compliance and\n        durability requirements.][22]\n    * * [Additives & ReinforcementsOur compounds can be enhanced with high-grade additive\n        concentrates to optimize your products.][23]\n      * [Customizable Base MaterialsLearn about the wide variety of resins, processes, and\n        applications we use to meet your end-product performance requirements.][24]\n* [Industries][25]\n  * * * Solutions for Your Industry\n        \n        We work with manufacturers in high-stakes industries like healthcare, automotive,\n        electronics and building materials where performance, compliance and reliability are\n        essential.\n        \n        [Explore industry-specific polymer solutions][26]\n    * * [Building & ConstructionMaterials that withstand weather, UV, and structural demands in\n        outdoor and load-bearing applications.][27]\n      * [TransportationEngineered compounds built for durability, compliance, and reliability across\n        vehicles, aircraft, ag, and power sports.][28]\n      * [FibersSoftness, strength, and stability for nonwovens, synthetic turf, hygiene products,\n        and performance textiles.][29]\n    * * [PackagingCustom masterbatches and additives for barrier performance, clarity, and\n        sustainable packaging formats.][30]\n      * [HealthcareMedical-grade materials engineered for biocompatibility, sterilization, and\n        global regulatory compliance.][31]\n      * [ElectronicsFlame-retardant, antistatic, and heat-resistant compounds for electronic\n        housings and sensitive components.][32]\n    * * [IndustrialHigh-strength, chemical-resistant materials designed for demanding environments\n        and engineered systems.][33]\n* [Services & Expertise][34]\n  * * * Services & Expertise\n        \n        Americhem isn’t just a compounder, we are a full-service extension of your engineering,\n        marketing, and product development teams.\n        \n        [Learn about our Services][35]\n    * * [Analytical TestingPrecision testing for performance, compliance, and quality\n        assurance.][36]\n      * [Product Design ServicesCollaborative design support for function, form, and\n        manufacturability.][37]\n      * [Custom ManufacturingFlexible, scalable production tailored to your exact formulation\n        needs.][38]\n    * * [Customer Process SimulationSimulate real-world processing to speed development and reduce\n        risk.][39]\n      * [Field ServicesOn-site technical support for trials, troubleshooting, and optimization.][40]\n    * * [CertificationsGlobal certifications that ensure material quality and compliance.][41]\n      * [SustainabilitySolutions that support your environmental and sustainability goals.][42]\n* [About][43]\n  * * * About Americhem\n        \n        For more than eight decades, Americham has been your trusted global partner in designing and\n        manufacturing polymer solutions.\n        \n        [Learn more about Americhem][44]\n    * * [LocationsGlobal reach with local expertise, explore Americhem’s worldwide footprint.][45]\n      * [LeadershipMeet the experts guiding Americhem’s vision, innovation, and global growth.][46]\n    * * [DEIWe foster a culture where diversity, equity, and inclusion drive stronger\n        solutions.][47]\n      * [RegulatoryCommitted to compliance, quality, and customer assurance at every stage.][48]\n    * * [[A group of people sit around tables in a conference room, listening to a speaker at a\n        podium; one woman gestures while speaking.][A group of people sit around tables in a\n        conference room, listening to a speaker at a podium; one woman gestures while\n        speaking.]][49]\n      * [CareersEnhance your career with opportunities in Specialty Compounds, Color Masterbatch,\n        Research & Development, Manufacturing, and Sales.][50]\n* [Talk to an Expert][51]\nSearch\n* [Products & Materials][52]\n  * [Masterbatch Technology][53]\n  * [Functional Technology][54]\n  * [Performance Compounds][55]\n  * [Engineered Compounds][56]\n  * [Customizable Base Materials][57]\n  * [Additives & Reinforcements][58]\n* [Industries][59]\n  * [Healthcare][60]\n  * [Building & Construction][61]\n  * [Fibers][62]\n  * [Transportation][63]\n  * [Packaging][64]\n  * [Electronics][65]\n  * [Industrial][66]\n* [Services & Expertise][67]\n  * [Analytical Testing][68]\n  * [Product Design Services][69]\n  * [Custom Manufacturing][70]\n  * [Customer Process Simulation][71]\n  * [Field Services][72]\n  * [Certifications][73]\n  * [Sustainability][74]\n* [About][75]\n  * [Locations][76]\n  * [Leadership][77]\n  * [Regulatory][78]\n  * [DEI][79]\n  * [Careers][80]\n* [Talk to an Expert][81]\n* [Careers][82]\n* [Sustainability][83]\n* [Technical Data Sheets][84]\n* [Resource Library][85]\n  * [Case Studies][86]\n  * [White Papers][87]\n  * [Webinars][88]\n  * [Videos][89]\n  * [Articles][90]\n  * [News][91]\n  * [Events][92]\n  * [Marketing Materials][93]\n  * [Quality Manual][94]\n[Talk to an Expert][95]\nPause\n\n# Custom compounding and masterbatch manufacturer\n\n## High-Performance Custom Masterbatch & Thermoplastic Compound Solutions\n\nYour trusted global partner in designing and manufacturing polymer solutions.\n\n[Request a Custom Solution][96]\n\n## Thermoplastic Compounds & Masterbatch for Every Application\n\nAmerichem is a global masterbatch manufacturer and provider of custom thermoplastic compounds\nserving demanding industries worldwide. Our product families are built to meet the highest demands\nfor performance, appearance and regulatory compliance. Whether you need a custom color masterbatch,\npolymeric additive, or full compound solution, we formulate for the specifications that deliver\nperformance.\n\n[\n[A gloved hand holds and lets fall a stream of small, dark red pellets.][A gloved hand holds and\nlets fall a stream of small, dark red pellets.]\n\n### Masterbatch Technology\n\nCustom color masterbatches and additive masterbatches designed for precision, consistency and\nappearance-critical parts.\n\n][97]\n[\n[Interior of a car showing black leather seats, center console with automatic gear shift, and\ndashboard controls.][Interior of a car showing black leather seats, center console with automatic\ngear shift, and dashboard controls.]\n\n### Functional\n### Technology\n\nThermoplastic additive technologies including softening agents, flame retardants, UV stabilizers,\nantimicrobials and more.\n\n][98]\n[\n[A doctor in a white coat with a stethoscope around the neck holds a tablet device; a blurred\nmedical professional is visible in the background.][A doctor in a white coat with a stethoscope\naround the neck holds a tablet device; a blurred medical professional is visible in the background.]\n\n### Performance Compounds\n\nEngineered compounds for strength, impact resistance, heat deflection and chemical compatibility.\n\n][99]\n[\n[A close-up of a surgeon’s gloved hand holding a laparoscopic surgical instrument during a minimally\ninvasive procedure.][A close-up of a surgeon’s gloved hand holding a laparoscopic surgical\ninstrument during a minimally invasive procedure.]\n\n### Engineered Compounds\n\nCustom formulations developed to meet unique end-use, compliance and durability requirements.\n\n][100]\n\n## When Excellence Is the Only Option, Americhem Delivers\n\nWe formulate engineered thermoplastic compounds and masterbatch that meet critical to function\ncriteria, and perform in the real world. You get a material solution that works the first time and\nevery time after.\n\n[Talk to a Solutions Expert][101]\n\n[Two workers in safety gear look at a computer screen; one is seated while the other stands and\npoints at the monitor, both wearing orange caps and reflective stripes.][Two workers in safety gear\nlook at a computer screen; one is seated while the other stands and points at the monitor, both\nwearing orange caps and reflective stripes.]\n\n## Industry-Specific Polymer Solutions for High-Stakes Applications\n\nYour Business is Our Specialty.\n\nWe work with manufacturers in high-stakes industries like healthcare, transportation, electronics\nand building materials where performance, compliance and reliability are essential.\n\n[\n[A green caduceus symbol with two serpents entwined around a winged staff.][A green caduceus symbol\nwith two serpents entwined around a winged staff.]\n\n### Healthcare\n\n][102]\n[\n[A simple grid pattern with yellow-green intersecting lines over a gray background, forming\nrectangles and squares on a black backdrop.][A simple grid pattern with yellow-green intersecting\nlines over a gray background, forming rectangles and squares on a black backdrop.]\n\n### Synthetic Fibers & Textiles\n\n][103]\n[\n[A yellow-green outline of a cardboard box, open at the top, with lines suggesting flaps and\ndepth.][A yellow-green outline of a cardboard box, open at the top, with lines suggesting flaps and\ndepth.]\n\n### Packaging\n\n][104]\n[\n[A simple green and gray pixelated outline of a factory with a tall chimney and a rectangular\nbuilding on a black background.][A simple green and gray pixelated outline of a factory with a tall\nchimney and a rectangular building on a black background.]\n\n### Industrial\n\n][105]\n[\n[Outline of two industrial buildings, one with a triangular roof and the other with a tower-like\nstructure, depicted in gray and green lines.][Outline of two industrial buildings, one with a\ntriangular roof and the other with a tower-like structure, depicted in gray and green lines.]\n\n### Building & Construction\n\n][106]\n[\n[A light green abstract line pattern with intersecting curves and angles on a transparent\nbackground.][A light green abstract line pattern with intersecting curves and angles on a\ntransparent background.]\n\n### Transportation\n\n][107]\n[\n[A square geometric pattern featuring olive green and gray shapes with symmetrical lines and\nconcentric designs.][A square geometric pattern featuring olive green and gray shapes with\nsymmetrical lines and concentric designs.]\n\n### Electronics\n\n][108]\n[A person wearing blue gloves and a white lab coat inspects or handles strips of white fabric or\nmaterial in an industrial or laboratory setting.][A person wearing blue gloves and a white lab coat\ninspects or handles strips of white fabric or material in an industrial or laboratory setting.]\n\n## We Solve Problems Others Walk Away From\n\nWhen off-the-shelf materials fall short on performance, processability, color, or compliance\nrequirements, Americhem helps teams develop a better-fit solution.\n\n[Contact One of Our Experts][109]\n\n## In Practice: Americhem’s Video Series on Real-World Material Performance\n\nThrough conversations with engineers and technical experts, *In Practice* explores what happens when\nmateria"
