ts to the pattern.\n\n#### Process\n* **Step 1**: A consultation to discuss your inspiration, project requirements, and timing.\n* **Step 2**: Both parties sign a contract detailing the deliverables and delivery date. The $200\n  deposit is paid.\n* **Step 3**: Our designer presents a minimum of three concept options. Client makes final decision\n  on which option to pursue.\n* **Step 4**: The pattern is presented. If needed, two rounds of minor revisions are included.\n  Additional revisions will incur a fee.\n* **Step 5**: Final pattern is completed and all files delivered. Final payment is due.\n* Please note: If you decide not to purchase the finished pattern, the deposit will not be refunded.\n\n## Complete Exclusivity\n\n#### Pricing\n* $2000 for one pattern in one colorway.\n  * A $500 non-refundable deposit is required, with the balance due upon completion.\n\n#### Licensing Detail\n* You own the right to copyright the pattern. The pattern will never appear in the Design Pool\n  pattern library.\n\n#### Process\n* **Step 1**: A consultation to discuss your inspiration, project requirements, and timing.\n* **Step 2**: Both parties sign a contract detailing the deliverables and delivery "
