erns download in Vector format, which offers scalability without losing resolution.\n\n[Experienced Designers]\n\n#### Experienced Designers\n\nOur award-winning designers have many years of industry experience. [Meet the designers][37]\n\n[Printer Connections]\n\n#### Printer Connections\n\nLove a pattern but need a printer? We can connect you with trusted printers. Learn more\n\n### INSPIRATION FROM THE BLOG\n\nOn the Design Pool blog, we give you an inside look at the stories and inspiration behind our\npatterns and collections. We also share valuable trend research so you can stay updated on industry\nnews and trends.\n\nBE INSPIRED Sign up for a weekly Inspiration\n* [ [The Benefits of Window Film for Homes and Businesses: Improve Comfort, Save Energy, and Protect\n  Your Interior] ][38]\n  \n  #### The Benefits of Window Film for Homes and Businesses: Improve Comfort, Save Energy, and\n  #### Protect Your Interior\n  \n  [Learn More][39]\n\n#### Design/Color Trends and Awesome Information In Your Inbox\n\nSign up for our monthly trend letter\n\nEmail\n\n#### My Account\n* [My Account][40]\n* [Manage Cookies][41]\n* [Wishlist][42]\n\n#### Learn More\n* [Website Terms of Use][43]\n* [Privacy Policy][44]\n\n#### Resources\n* [Blog][45]\n* [Browse Our Designs][46]\n\n#### About Us\n* [About Us][47]\n* [Press/Media][48]\n* [FAQ][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n* © Design Pool. 2026. All Rights Reserved\n* [Sitemap][51]\n* [info@designpoolpatterns.com][52]\n\n## Custom Design\n\nNeed exclusive patterns for your brand? Let's get started!\n\nDesign Pool's experienced designers excel at creating successful patterns for any market.\n\n## Custom License\n\n#### Pricing\n* $700 for one pattern in one colorway.\n  * A $200 non-refundable deposit is required, with the balance due upon completion.\n\n#### Licensing Details\n* You have a one-year exclusive license to the pattern.\n* After one year, the pattern is added to the Design Pool pattern library.\n* Design Pool owns the rights to the pattern.\n\n#### Process\n* **Step 1**: A consultation to discuss your inspiration, project requirements, and timing.\n* **Step 2**: Both parties sign a contract detailing the deliverables and delivery date. The $200\n  deposit is paid.\n* **Step 3**: Our designer presents a minimum of three concept options. Client makes final decision\n  on which option to pursue.\n* **Step 4**: The pattern is presented. If needed, two rounds of minor revisions are included.\n  Additional revisions will incur a fee.\n* **Step 5**: Final pattern is completed and all files delivered. Final payment is due.\n* Please note: If you decide not to purchase the finished pattern, the deposit will not be refunded.\n\n## Complete Exclusivity\n\n#### Pricing\n* $2000 for one pattern in one colorway.\n  * A $500 non-refundable deposit is required, with the balance due upon completion.\n\n#### Licensing Detail\n* You own the right to copyright the pattern. The pattern will never appear in the Design Pool\n  pattern library.\n\n#### Process\n* **Step 1**: A consultation to discuss your inspiration, project requirements, and timing.\n* **Step 2**: Both parties sign a contract detailing the deliverables and delivery date. The $200\n  deposit is paid.\n* **Step 3**: Our designer presents a minimum of three concept options. Client makes final decision\n  on which option to pursue.\n* **Step 4**: The pattern is presented. If needed, two rounds of revisions are included. Additional\n  revisions will incur a fee.\n* **Step 5**: Final pattern is completed and all files delivered. Final payment is due.\n* Please note: If you decide not to purchase the finished pattern the deposit will not be refunded.\n\nIf you have any questions please contact us: [info@designpoolpatterns.com][53]\n\n## Ready To Get Started?\n\nTell us about yourself and your project. The more details you can share, the better! Have visuals of\ninspiration? Attach them below or include a link to a Pinterest board or mood board.\n\n\"*\" indicates required fields\n\nYour Full Name**\nPhone Number**\nEmail*\nYour Email Address* Confirm Your Email Address*\nCustom Type*\nCustom LicenseComplete Exclusivity\nDesign End Use*\nAny Scale Restrictions*\nIs there a pattern in our library whose style or aesthetic you like?*\nTell us about your pattern requirements. Provide as much detail as possible. Colors, Shapes,\nTextiles, Style, etc.*\nAttachments\nPlease provide any attachments for inspiration. **PLEASE NOTE: We can not copy any design unless you\nhave proof you own the copyright.**\nDrop files here or Select files\nMax. file size: 100 MB.\nMonthly Trend Letter\nKeep me inspired with design and color updates.\n\n## Start Your Own Line of Products\n\n### Design and sell your product line!\n\nWith over 12 years of print-on-demand experience, we can help you start your own line or products\nfrom inception to marketing.\n\n### Currect Products:\n* Wallpaper / Wallcovering\n* Window Films - Frosted and Woven\n* Vinyl flooring\n* Ceramic Mugs\n* Enamel Mugs\n* Ceramic Tiles\n* Privacy Screen\n* Lignt Lens\n* Woven Window Film\n\n### Pattern Options:\n\nLicense from Design Pool!\n[Search out library][54] and find the perfect designs for your product.\n\nUpload your own designs!\n\n### Need Help with Your Designs:\n\nWe can help rescale or recolor and of the Design Pool patterns to further make them your own. We can\nhelp you with your own designs by prepping them for digital printing:\n* Scanning your artwork into the computer\n* Putting your artwork in repeat\n* Sizing your artwork to the specific product\n\n### Need Help Marketing Your Products?\n\nWe can connect you with our product marketing expert who .... (Nicole)\n\n## Ready to Get Started\n\nPlease full out information below and someone will reach out to you within 48 hours.\n\nYour Full Name*(Required)\nPhone Number*(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nEmail* Email Confirmation*\nI am interested in learning more about (choose as many as applicable)*(Required)\nSpeaking to a printer to understand print-on-demand and the products, pricing, and timing.\nI am interested in converting my graphics into digital print files.\nI would like to learn more about marketing my products.\nTell us a bit more about yourself*(Required)\nIam an interior designer, looking to offer my own product line.\nI am graphic designer, looking to offer my own product line.\nI am an established company looking to expand my product offering.\nOther\nOther\nMonthly Trend Letter\nKeep me inspired with design and color updates.\n\nIf you have any questions please contact us: [info@designpoolpatterns.com][55]\n\n[beinspired]\n\ntest Subscribe today and have trends, news, and inspiration delivered straight to your inbox.\n\nI am (please select)(Required)\nInterior DesignerDigital PrinterProduct DesignerHome Decor Enthusiast\nEmail Address(Required)\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\ndont show popup\nDon't show this popup again\n\n[1]: #site-content\n[2]: mailto:info@designpoolpatterns.com\n[3]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/my-account/\n[4]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/dpool/\n[5]: /\n[6]: /shop/\n[7]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/blog/\n[8]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/about/\n[9]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/events/\n[10]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/faq/\n[11]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/wishlist/\n[12]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/contact/\n[13]: /shop/\n[14]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/blog/\n[15]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/about/\n[16]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/events/\n[17]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/faq/\n[18]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/wishlist/\n[19]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/contact/\n[20]: mailto:info@designpoolpatterns.com\n[21]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/dpool/?action=register\n[22]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/my-account/\n[23]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/dpool/\n[24]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/shop/?_sf_s=zecchino%20\n[25]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/shop/?_sft_collection=swallowtail-farm%20\n[26]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/shop/?_sf_s=knowledge%20is%20power%20\n[27]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/shop/?_sf_s=urban%20garden%20\n[28]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/shop/?_sf_s=muse%20and%20memory%20\n[29]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/shop/?_sf_s=community%20garden%20\n[30]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/shop/?_sf_s=paper%20cut%20\n[31]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/shop/?_sf_s=tuscany%20%20\n[32]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/shop/?_sf_s=the%20netherlands%20\n[33]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/shop/?_sft_technique=watercolor\n[34]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/shop/?_sft_pattern-theme=starburst\n[35]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/shop/?_sft_product_cat=geometric\n[36]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/shop/?_sft_product_cat=landscape\n[37]: /about/#meet-the-designers\n[38]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/the-benefits-of-window-film-for-homes-and-businesses-improv\ne-comfort-save-energy-and-protect-your-interior/\n[39]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/the-benefits-of-window-film-for-homes-and-businesses-improv\ne-comfort-save-energy-and-protect-your-interior/\n[40]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/my-account/\n[41]: #\n[42]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/wishlist/\n[43]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/terms/\n[44]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/privacy-policy/\n[45]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/blog/\n[46]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/shop/\n[47]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/about/\n[48]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/press/\n[49]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/faq/\n[50]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/contact/\n[51]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/sitemap/\n[52]: mailto:info@designpoolpatterns.com\n[53]: mailto:info@designpoolpatterns.com?subject=Custom Design\n[54]: https://www.designpoolpatterns.com/licensable-desi