          "summary": "[ [BASF - We create chemistry] ][1]\n* [ Markets ][2]\n  * [ General Pest Control ][3]\n  * [ Termite Control ][4]\n* [ Products ][5]\n* [ Solutions ][6]\n  * [ Ants ][7]\n  * [ Bed Bugs ][8]\n  * [ Cockroaches ][9]\n  * [ Fleas ][10]\n  * [ Flies ][11]\n  * [ Occasional Invaders ][12]\n  * [ Rodents ][13]\n  * [ Scorpions ][14]\n  * [ Mosquitos ][15]\n  * [ Termite Control ][16]\n    * [ Liquid Termiticides ][17]\n    * [ Termite Baits ][18]\n    * [ Termite Monitoring ][19]\n    * [ Termidor® Restoration ][20]\n  * [ PT Brands ][21]\n* [ News & Events ][22]\n* [ Training & Education ][23]\n* [ Partner Resources ][24]\n  * [ BASF Pest Control Products and Solutions | How to Become a BASF Certified Pest Control Partner\n    ][25]\n* [ Rep Finder ][26]\n* [ Contact Us ][27]\nSearch \n[ [Achieve Peak Performance with Alpine Brand Insecticides] ][28]\n[Pest Control][29]\n[Contact][30]\n* [ Markets ][31]\n  * [ General Pest Control ][32]\n  * [ Termite Control ][33]\n* [ Products ][34]\n* [ Solutions ][35]\n  * [ Ants ][36]\n  * [ Bed Bugs ][37]\n  * [ Cockroaches ][38]\n  * [ Fleas ][39]\n  * [ Flies ][40]\n  * [ Occasional Invaders ][41]\n  * [ Rodents ][42]\n  * [ Scorpions ][43]\n  * [ Mosquitos ][44]\n  * [ Termites ][45]\n    * [ Liquid Termiticides ][46]\n    * [ Termite Baits ][47]\n    * [ Termite Monitoring ][48]\n    * [ Termidor® Restoration ][49]\n  * [ PT Brands ][50]\n* [ News & Events ][51]\n* [ Training & Education ][52]\n* [ Partner Resources ][53]\n* [ Rep Finder ][54]\n* [ Contact Us ][55]\n...\n1. [ Home ][56]\n2. [ BASF Agricultural Solutions LLC ][57]\n3. [ Professional & Specialty Solutions ][58]\n4. [ Urban & Rural Pest Control ][59]\n...\n\n# Pest Management Solutions for Pest Management Professionals\n\nBASF offers a comprehensive portfolio of modern pest control solutions for the most demanding pest\nmanagement professionals. Whether your specific area is residential, commercial, pre-construction,\nor post-construction, BASF has the products with a proven track record of results and the people\nwith a commitment to growing your profit potential.\n\n \n\nDriven by the principles of innovation, sustainability, and collaboration, BASF is constantly\ninvesting in the research and development of new pest control products and services that improve\nquality of life for people around the world. We move beyond yesterday’s best chemistries to provide\nbetter ways for PMPs to succeed today.\n\n[Join us]\n\n## **Stay informed!**\n\nSubscribe to our monthly newsletter for the latest programs, product updates, advice and technical\ninsights.\n\nJOIN US\n\n## Labels, SDS and State Availability\n\n[ Find a label or SDS ][60]\n[ View only pest control products, labels & SDS ][61]\n\n## Rep Finder\n\n[ Find a BASF representative in your area. ][62]\n\n## Sign up for Pest Control email\n\n[ Get the latest delivered straight to your inbox ][63]\n\n## Elevate the Routine with PT Specialty Brands from BASF\n\nThis video demonstrates where to effectively apply specialty solutions like PT Alpine Pressurized\nFly Bait, PT Tri-Die and more. \n\n[ WATCH REPLAY ][64]\n[ [Elevate the Routine with PT Specialty Brands from BASF] ][65]\n\n## **Perimeter Pro Webinar**\n\n[ [Three Solutions, One Purpose: Smarter Pest Control with Alpine WSG, Fendona CS and Ridesco WG. ]\n][66]\n\n## One Purpose: Smarter Pest Control with Alpine WSG, Fendona CS and Ridesco WG. \n\nIn this webinar from our Perimeter Pro series, Technical Services Rep. Desiree Straubinger, BCE,\nCP-FS, covers advanced pest control strategies, long-lasting residual treatments and targeted\napplications for perimeter pests and mosquito management.\n\n[ WATCH REPLAY ][67]\n\n## Termidor Termiticides/Insecticides: 25 Years of Provent Termite Control\n\nIn this Perimeter Pro webinar, Dr. Bob Davis, BCE, covers approved Termidor® termiticide/insecticide\ntreatment methods for pre-construction and post-construction; highlights the importance of\nrestoration treatments, and more.\n\n[ WATCH REPLAY ][68]\n[ [Science Behind Termidor] ][69]\n\n## **Sponsored webinars**\n\n## Stop the Swarm: Confidently Control Active Termite Infestations\n\nFocusing on the Termidor^{®} family and Trelona^{®} ATBS Annual Bait Stations, Dr. Freder Medina,\nBCE, discusses common job scenarios, decisions around liquid vs. bait, and other strategies for\nconsistent, quality service for your customers.\n\n[ WATCH REPLAY ][70]\n[ [Stop the Swarm: Confidently Control Active Termite Infestations] ][71]\n[ [Switch Made Simple: Two Paths to Smarter Rodent Control] ][72]\n\n## Switch Made Simple: Two Paths to Smarter Rodent Control\n\n A well-rounded rodent IPM program: Selontra® Rodent Bait delivers fast, effective results and new\nnon-toxic Prelontra™ Rodent Monitoring Soft Block measures rodent activity before, during, or after\ncontrol efforts.\n\n[ WATCH REPLAY ][73]\n\n## Markets\n\n[ [Market Category Page - General Pest Control] ][74]\n\n## General Pest Control\n\nThe BASF General Pest Control portfolio combines the industry’s smartest solutions and strategies to\nhelp manage existing and emerging pest control challenges including ants, c"
