SF has the products with a proven track record of results and the people\nwith a commitment to growing your profit potential.\n\n \n\nDriven by the principles of innovation, sustainability, and collaboration, BASF is constantly\ninvesting in the research and development of new pest control products and services that improve\nquality of life for people around the world. We move beyond yesterday’s best chemistries to provide\nbetter ways for PMPs to succeed today.\n\n[Join us]\n\n## **Stay informed!**\n\nSubscribe to our monthly newsletter for the latest programs, product updates, advice and technical\ninsights.\n\nJOIN US\n\n## Labels, SDS and State Availability\n\n[ Find a label or SDS ][60]\n[ View only pest control products, labels & SDS ][61]\n\n## Rep Finder\n\n[ Find a BASF representative in your area. ][62]\n\n## Sign up for Pest Control email\n\n[ Get the latest delivered straight to your inbox ][63]\n\n## Elevate the Routine with PT Specialty Brands from BASF\n\nThis video demonstrates where to effectively apply specialty solutions like PT Alpine Pressurized\nFly Bait, PT Tri-Die and more. \n\n[ WATCH REPLAY ][64]\n[ [Elevate the Routine with PT Specialty Brands from BASF] ][65]\n\n## **Perimeter Pro Webinar**\n\n[ [Three Solutions, One Purpose: Smarter Pest Control with Alpine WSG, Fendona CS and Ridesco WG. ]\n][66]\n\n## One Purpose: Smarter Pest Control with Alpine WSG, Fendona CS and Ridesco WG. \n\nIn this webinar from our Perimeter Pro series, Technical Services Rep. Desiree Straubinger, BCE,\nCP-FS, covers advanced pest control strategies, long-lasting residual treatments and targeted\napplications for perimeter pests and mosquito management.\n\n[ WATCH REPLAY ][67]\n\n## Termidor Termiticides/Insecticides: 25 Years of Provent Termite Control\n\nIn this Perimeter Pro webinar, Dr. Bob Davis, BCE, covers approved Termidor® termiticide/insecticide\ntreatment methods for pre-construction and post-construction; highlights the importance of\nrestoration treatments, and more.\n\n[ WATCH REPLAY ][68]\n[ [Science Behind Termidor] ][69]\n\n## **Sponsored webinars**\n\n## Stop the Swarm: Confidently Control Active Termite Infestations\n\nFocusing on the Termidor^{®} family and Trelona^{®} ATBS Annual Bait Stations, Dr. Freder Medina,\nBCE, discusses common job scenarios, decisions around liquid vs. bait, and other strategies for\nconsistent, quality service for your customers.\n\n[ WATCH REPLAY ][70]\n[ [Stop the Swarm: Confidently Control Active Termite Infestations] ][71]\n[ [Switch Made Simple: Two Paths to Smarter Rodent Control] ][72]\n\n## Switch Made Simple: Two Paths to Smarter Rodent Control\n\n A well-rounded rodent IPM program: Selontra® Rodent Bait delivers fast, effective results and new\nnon-toxic Prelontra™ Rodent Monitoring Soft Block measures rodent activity before, during, or after\ncontrol efforts.\n\n[ WATCH REPLAY ][73]\n\n## Markets\n\n[ [Market Category Page - General Pest Control] ][74]\n\n## General Pest Control\n\nThe BASF General Pest Control portfolio combines the industry’s smartest solutions and strategies to\nhelp manage existing and emerging pest control challenges including ants, cockroaches, rodents,\nflies, bed bugs, mosquitos, scorpions and occasional invaders.\n\nGeneral Pest Control Market\n[ [Market Category Page - Termite] ][75]\n\n## **Termite Control**\n\nFrom the power of industry-leading liquids and foam to best-in-class baiting and monitoring, our\noptions can help you build a termite solutions program that meets any situation, ensuring satisfied\ncustomers and a strong bottom line for your business.\n\nTermite Control Market\n\n## **Highlights**\n\n[**See all**][76]\n\n[ ][77]\n\n## Essential Residential Solutions\n\nThis illustration shows where to apply BASF solutions that will help achieve the most effective\nresults for your residential customers, and covers outdoor maintenance, indoor maintenance, rodent\ncontrol, termite control and active infestations.\n\n[ Learn More ][78]\n[ ][79]\n\n## Essential Commercial Solutions\n\nFrom inspections to initial services to pest specific treatments, this illustration shows where to\napply BASF solutions that will help achieve the most effective results for your commercial accounts.\n\n[ Learn More ][80]\n[ [View Catalogue] ][81]\n\n## Pest Control Solutions Product Catalog\n\nWith a powerful portfolio and an expert team, BASF has proudly supplied the Pest Control industry\nwith cutting-edge chemistries and reliable support for decades.\n\n[ Download Now ][82]\n[ [View all BASF Pest Control Products] ][83]\n\n## View all BASF Pest Control Products\n\nView all product labels and Safety Data Sheets (SDS)\n\n[ All Labels and SDS ][84]\nPrint\n**Share With Us**\n* [Twitter][85]\n* [FaceBook][86]\n* [Instagram][87]\n* * [Product Finder][88]\n  * [Past Products][89]\n  * [Sitemap][90]\n  * [About Us][91]\n  * [Data Privacy (basf.com)][92]\n  * [Careers][93]\n  * [Disclaimer][94]\n* * [Sustainability][95]\n  * [Innovation][96]\n  * [Diversity][97]\n  * [News & Media][98]\n  * [BASF Global][99]\n  * [Executive Profiles][100]\n* * [Why Join BASF][101]\n  * [News Releases][102]\n  * [Multimedia][103]\n  * [Credits][104]\n  * [Supplier & Partners][105]\n  * [Supplier Diversity][106]\n  * [Security Incident Reporting][107]\n* * [Strategy & Organization][108]\n  * [What’s New][109]\n  * [Management and Instruments][110]\n  * [Our Research][111]\n  * [Our Innovations][112]\n* * [Investor Relations][113]\n* * [Data Privacy][114]\n* Copyright ©2026 BASF Agricultural Solutions US LLC\n\n[1]: https://pestcontrol.basf.us\n[2]: https://pestcontrol.basf.us/\n[3]: /markets/general-pest-control.html\n[4]: /markets/termites.html\n[5]: /products.html\n[6]: /solutions.html\n[7]: /solutions/ants.html\n[8]: /solutions/bed-bugs.html\n[9]: /solutions/cockroaches.html\n[10]: /solutions/fleas.html\n[11]: /solutions/flies.html\n[12]: /solutions/occasional-invaders.html\n[13]: /solutions/rodents.html\n[14]: /solutions/scorpions