          "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* No. #16, Elegance Royale, G6, B&C, First Floor, 2nd Cross, JC Road, Bangalore 560002\n* [ info@shanthiindustries.com ][2]\n* [ +91 - 99022 98755 ][3]\n[ [Shanthi Industries – high-quality yarn and fibers manufacturer] ][4]\n* [Home][5]\n* [About Us][6]\n* [Products][7]\n  * [BCF Yarn][8]\n  * [Monofilament Yarn][9]\n    * [Advanced Technical Textiles][10]\n    * [Monofilament Bristle for Household Brushes][11]\n    * [Monofilament Bristle for Industrial Brushes][12]\n    * [Monofilament Bristle for Oral Care Brushes][13]\n  * [Nylon Yarn][14]\n  * [Polyester Yarn][15]\n  * [Polyethylene Yarn][16]\n  * [PLA Yarn][17]\n  * [Fibers][18]\n  * [PPMF Yarn][19]\n* [Blogs][20]\n* [Contact Us][21]\n* [Home][22]\n* [About Us][23]\n* [Products][24]\n  * [BCF Yarn][25]\n  * [Monofilament Yarn][26]\n    * [Advanced Technical Textiles][27]\n    * [Monofilament Bristle for Household Brushes][28]\n    * [Monofilament Bristle for Industrial Brushes][29]\n    * [Monofilament Bristle for Oral Care Brushes][30]\n  * [Nylon Yarn][31]\n  * [Polyester Yarn][32]\n  * [Polyethylene Yarn][33]\n  * [PLA Yarn][34]\n  * [Fibers][35]\n  * [PPMF Yarn][36]\n* [Blogs][37]\n* [Contact Us][38]\n[ Enquire ][39]\n\n###### Where innovation meets high-performance\n\n# Synthetic Fiber & Monofilament Experts\n\nShanthi Industries excels in cutting-edge polymer monofilaments for various industries. Our polymer\nexpertise delivers versatile solutions for global applications.\n\n[ Discover more ][40]\n\n###### Who we are\n\n## Excellence in Man made Fiber Manufacturing & Exports\n\nWelcome to Shanthi Industries, a trusted leader in the manufacture and export of high-quality\nsynthetic fibers. Driven by innovation and a commitment to excellence, we produce a diverse range of\nman-made fibers, including mono-filament, nylon, polyester, polypropylene, polyethylene, and\nspecialized BCF (Bulked Continuous Filament) yarn.\n\nOur products are crafted to meet the highest standards, serving industries such as textiles,\nautomotive, and furnishings with solutions that combine durability, flexibility, and environmental\nresponsibility.\n\n[ Discover more ][41]\n[Polyethylene yarn for cooling, fishing, and technical use]\n25+\nYears of Experience\n\nTextiles, Automotive, Healthcare & Furnishings: Expertly Crafted\n\nA leader in Synthetic man-made Fibers, driving industrial progress\nIndustries Served\n0 +\nGlobal Reach\n0 +\nProduct Variants\n0 +\n\n## A Trusted Partner in Reinforcement, Filtration, and Healthcare Solutions\n\nExplore Shanthi’s advanced monofilaments for heat resistance and conductivity.\n\nMonofilament Yarn\n\nHigh-performance yarns offering diverse applications, including heat resistance, conductivity, and\ndurability for various industries.\n\n[ Learn more ][42]\n[Polyester monofilament yarn for zipper teeth and more]\n* Polyster Monofilament yarn\n* Nylon Monofilament Yarn\n* Special MonoFilament yarn\n* Biocomponent Monofilament yarn\n* Polyethylene & Polypropylene Monofliament yarn\n* Polyester Monofilament For Zipper Teeth\n* Conductive Nylon & PPS Monofilament yarn\nBCF Yarn\n* Polyester BCF Yarn\n* Nylon BCF Yarn\n* Polypropylene BCF Yarn\n[Nylon BCF yarn for strong, flexible carpets]\n\nVersatile yarns designed for robust applications, offering flexibility and strength across multiple\nindustrial uses.\n\n[ Learn more ][43]\nNylon Yarn\n* Trimmer Line\n* Longline Fishing Line\n* Fishing Line\n* Invisible Sewing Thread\n* Racket Strings\n[Flexible and strong nylon trimline for outdoor tools]\n\nDurable yarns ideal for demanding applications, providing strength, resistance, and flexibility for\nvarious sectors.\n\n[ Learn more ][44]\nFibers\n* Fibrillated Tape yarn & Concrete Reinforcing Fiber\n* Polypropylene Fiber & Staple Fiber\n* Hollow Conjugate Fiber.\n[Durable fibers for ropes, cords, and industrial sewing yarns]\n\nEngineered fibers offering reinforcement and support in concrete, fibers for industrial, and staple\napplications.\n\n[ Learn more ][45]\nPolyethylene Yarn\n* Braided Fishing Line\n* PE Cooling Filament Yarn & UHMWPE Filament Yarn\n[Polyethylene yarn for braided lines and PE filament uses]\n\nSpecialized yarns designed for extreme durability and high strength, ideal for heavy-duty\napplications like fishing lines.\n\n[ Learn more ][46]\nPolyester Yarn\n* Polyster Strapping\n* Polyster Wires\n[Quality polyethylene and polypropylene yarn]\n\nDurable, versatile yarns providing superior strength and performance for industrial and commercial\nuse.\n\n[ Learn more ][47]\nPLA Yarn\n* PLA Filament\n[Eco-friendly PLA yarn for sustainable textile applications]\n\nSustainable filament yarn made from renewable resources, offering eco-friendly solutions for various\napplications.\n\n[ Learn more ][48]\n\n###### Why Choose us\n\n## Innovative Functional Monofilaments\n\nAdvanced monofilaments engineered with heat resistance, conductivity, anti-radiation, and high\nabsorption properties.\n\nInnovative Functional Monofilaments\n\nAdvanced monofilaments offering heat resistance, conductivity, anti-radiation, and high absorption\nproperties.\n\nDiverse Application Range\n\nServing industries like security, construction, healthcare, 3D printing, and environmental\nfiltration with versatile monofilament solutions.\n\nSpecialized Monofilament Products\n\nOffering high-quality fishing lines, tennis strings, and trimmer lines tailored to meet specific\nperformance needs.\n\nProprietary Research and Development\n\nBacked by a self-owned research institute, we lead innovation through national and provincial R&D\nprograms.\n\nIndustry Standards Leadership\n\nActively participating in formulating national and industrial standards for monofilament technology.\n\nCompletely Independent Intellectual Property\n\nLeveraging core technologies with fully independent intellectual property rights for unmatched\nquality and reliability.\n\n[Leather craft]\n\n## Get Started with Shanthi Industries Today!\n\nReach out now to explore innovative monofilament solutions tailored to your needs. Contact us for a\nconsultation, request samples, and start your journey towards advanced, high-performance products\nwith Shanthi Industries.\n\n[ Discover more ][49]\nDiscover Our Premium Monofilament Products\n\nBrowse our wide range of high-performance monofilament products designed for various industries.\nExplore now for durable, innovative solutions that meet your specific needs!\n\n###### How it works\n\n## Seamless Partnership Process\n\nOur streamlined four-stage process ensures customized solutions, timely delivery, and ongoing\nsupport for every client.\n\n[ Learn more ][50]\n\n##### Inquiry & Consultation\n\nInitiate contact to discuss your requirements. Our team will offer expert consultation to identify\nthe best solutions.\n\n##### Product Evaluation & Customization\n\nRequest product samples to assess quality and functionality. We tailor solutions to meet your\nspecific needs.\n\n##### Agreement & Order Confirmation\n\nFinalize terms, including pricing and delivery timelines, through a formal agreement. Order\nconfirmation follows.\n\n##### Production & Delivery\n\nOnce confirmed, production begins, followed by timely delivery and ongoing customer support for\nsmooth operations.\n\n## Blogs\n\n[\n[monofilament yarn in sports nets]\n][51]\n\n### [ Monofilament Yarn in Sports Nets: The Backbone of High-Performance Sports Equipment  ][52]\n\nWhen you watch a tennis ball smack against a net, a badminton shuttle skim just over the tape, or a\nsquash ball ricochet off\n\n[ Read More » ][53]\n[\n[monofilament yarn improves filtration efficiency]\n][54]\n\n### [ How Monofilament Yarn Improves Filtration Efficiency in Industrial Applications ][55]\n\nIndustrial filtration plays a critical role in maintaining product quality, protecting equipment,\nand ensuring operational efficiency across manufacturing sectors. Whether it is water treatment,\n\n[ Read More » ][56]\n[\n[Quality testing standards for monofilament yarn]\n][57]\n\n### [ Quality Testing Standards for Monofilament Yarn You Should Know  ][58]\n\nIn industries where precision, durability, and performance are critical, monofilament yarn plays a\nvital role. From industrial fabrics and filtration systems to fishing lines,\n\n[ Read More » ][59]\n[\n[biocomponent monofilament yarn]\n][60]\n\n### [ Bicomponent monofilament yarn: what it is and why manufacturers are switching to it  ][61]\n\nIn today’s competitive manufacturing landscape, industries are constantly seeking materials that\noffer better performance, durability, and cost efficiency. One innovation that has gained\nsignificant\n\n[ Read More » ][62]\n[\n[application of monofilament yarn]\n][63]\n\n### [ Top 10 Applications of Monofilament Yarn in Modern Industries  ][64]\n\nThe global manufacturing landscape is undergoing a massive shift, driven by the demand for materials\nthat offer high precision, durability, and versatility. Among these\n\n[ Read More » ][65]\n[\n[monofilament yarn in agriculture]\n][66]\n\n### [ Monofilament Yarn in Agriculture: Nets, Fencing & Crop Protection Solutions ][67]\n\nModern agriculture depends heavily on durable and efficient materials that can withstand changing\nweather conditions while protecting crops and improving productivity. One such innovation\n\n[ Read More » ][68]\n\n## Certifications\n\nView our Quality Certifications that ensure dedication towards excellence:\n\n### ISO 9001:2015\n\n### ISO 14001:2015\n\n### ISO 45001:2018\n\n### Global Recycled Standard\n\n### OEKO - TEX\n\n[Shanthi Industries – high-quality yarn and fibers manufacturer]\nShanthi Industries excels in cutting-edge polymer monofilaments for various industries. Our polymer\nexpertise delivers versatile solutions for global applications.\n\n##### Our Products\n* [ Home ][69]\n* [ About us ][70]\n* [ Contact Us ][71]\n* [ BCF Yarn ][72]\n* [ Monofilament Yarn ][73]\n* [ Nylon Yarn ][74]\n* [ Polyes