, TN 37664\n\n──────────┬────────────────────────────────────────\nThursday  │* 8AM–5PM                               \n          │Holiday hours Hours might differ        \n──────────┼────────────────────────────────────────\nFriday    │* 8AM–5PM                               \n          │Holiday hours Hours might differ        \n──────────┼────────────────────────────────────────\nSaturday  │* Closed                                \n          │Holiday hours Hours might differ        \n──────────┼────────────────────────────────────────\nSunday    │* Closed                                \n          │Holiday hours Hours might differ        \n──────────┼────────────────────────────────────────\nMonday    │* 8AM–5PM                               \n          │Holiday hours Hours might differ        \n──────────┼────────────────────────────────────────\nTuesday   │* 8AM–5PM                               \n          │Holiday hours Hours might differ        \n──────────┼────────────────────────────────────────\nWednesday │* 8AM–5PM                               \n          │Holiday hours Hours might differ        \n──────────┴────────────────────────────────────────\n\n\n\n4.9 (130)\n\n##### Description:\n\n-\n\n### Reviews\n\n[ Write review][54]\n\n[Chance Garza][55] Sept. 2, 2022, 6:15 a.m.\n\nAverage rating:\n5.0 / 5.0\n\nThis is a busy roofing season. With that in mind, we contacted them, signed a contract and had our\nnew roof installed in 6 weeks time. This was amazing! We even had calls to let us know we was not\nforgotten. The day after the material arrived the crew showed up. The crew was amazing. In 90 degree\nheat, they worked on ...through it. I would recommend this company to anyone. From the beginning of\nthis project to the end was people doing the job they was supposed to do. They did everything they\nsaid they would. We was going to chose from 5 quotes. However, one didn't even call back until we\nsigned a contract. The other one did not have a good review. Their price was better than all of\nthem. Our roof is gorgeous. I'm so glad we chose BDM. Thanks to each one that called, quoted,\ninstalled and cleaned up. You are the BEST!!! More text\n\n[Akiko Reyes][56] Sept. 2, 2022, 6:15 a.m.\n\nAverage rating:\n5.0 / 5.0\n\nI called around looking for a company that could repair my leaking skylight and BDM was literally\nthe first one that could. Amanda took my call and was so friendly and was able to send Dusty out\nwithin a few days. He was very courteous and professional. He assessed my skylight and determined\nthere was a small leak c...ausing interior leaking into my condo. He suggested the repairs needed.\nHe came back a second time and met with my insurance adjuster to further review with him the\nsituation secure the funds needed for the repairs. He really went above and beyond. Jared then\nhandled scheduling the skylight repair work and interior painting and it was done in a timely and\nprofessional manner. The professionalism and courteousness I experienced from BDM was amazing. I\nwould highly recommend BDM to anyone. More text\n\n[Jerrod Mcgee][57] Sept. 2, 2022, 6:15 a.m.\n\nAverage rating:\n5.0 / 5.0\n\nI cannot say kin"
